#: includes/accounts_page.php
msgid "Click 'Continue' to Delete the following Cloudflare Account. Its discovered inventory and job state are removed; Cacti devices and graphs are kept."
msgid_plural "Click 'Continue' to Delete the following Cloudflare Accounts. Their discovered inventory and job state are removed; Cacti devices and graphs are kept."
msgstr[0] "Kanda 'Komeza' kugira ngo Usibe Konti ya Cloudflare ikurikira. Urutonde rw'ibyo yabonye n'imimerere y'imirimo yayo biravanwaho; ibikoresho bya Cacti n'ibishushanyo biragumishwaho."
msgstr[1] "Kanda 'Komeza' kugira ngo Usibe Konti za Cloudflare zikurikira. Urutonde rw'ibyo zabonye n'imimerere y'imirimo yazo biravanwaho; ibikoresho bya Cacti n'ibishushanyo biragumishwaho."

#: includes/accounts_page.php
msgid "Click 'Continue' to Verify the following Cloudflare Account against the Cloudflare API."
msgid_plural "Click 'Continue' to Verify the following Cloudflare Accounts against the Cloudflare API."
msgstr[0] "Kanda 'Komeza' kugira ngo Ugenzure Konti ya Cloudflare ikurikira ukoresheje API ya Cloudflare."
msgstr[1] "Kanda 'Komeza' kugira ngo Ugenzure Konti za Cloudflare zikurikira ukoresheje API ya Cloudflare."

#: includes/accounts_page.php
msgid "Click 'Continue' to Enable the following Cloudflare Account."
msgid_plural "Click 'Continue' to Enable the following Cloudflare Accounts."
msgstr[0] "Kanda 'Komeza' kugira ngo Ufungure Konti ya Cloudflare ikurikira."
msgstr[1] "Kanda 'Komeza' kugira ngo Ufungure Konti za Cloudflare zikurikira."

#: includes/accounts_page.php
msgid "Click 'Continue' to Disable the following Cloudflare Account."
msgid_plural "Click 'Continue' to Disable the following Cloudflare Accounts."
msgstr[0] "Kanda 'Komeza' kugira ngo Uhagarike Konti ya Cloudflare ikurikira."
msgstr[1] "Kanda 'Komeza' kugira ngo Uhagarike Konti za Cloudflare zikurikira."

#: includes/accounts_page.php
msgid "Click 'Continue' to create a Cacti device for the following Cloudflare Account. An account that already has one is left as it is."
msgid_plural "Click 'Continue' to create a Cacti device for each of the following Cloudflare Accounts. An account that already has one is left as it is."
msgstr[0] "Kanda 'Komeza' kugira ngo ukore igikoresho cya Cacti kuri Konti ya Cloudflare ikurikira. Konti isanzwe igifite iguma uko iri."
msgstr[1] "Kanda 'Komeza' kugira ngo ukore igikoresho cya Cacti kuri buri Konti ya Cloudflare mu zikurikira. Konti isanzwe igifite iguma uko iri."

