#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Absolute path to the 32-byte key used to encrypt stored API tokens. It must be readable by the web server and poller users and not world-readable. When the file is missing, only token files can be used."
msgstr "Inzira yuzuye igana ku rufunguzo rwa byte 32 rukoreshwa mu gushyira mu ibanga token za API zibitse. Rugomba kuba rushobora gusomwa na seriveri y'urubuga n'abakoresha ba poller kandi nturushobore gusomwa na buri wese. Iyo dosiye ibura, dosiye za token gusa ni zo zishobora gukoreshwa."

