msgstr "Ububiko bwa Dosiye za Token"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Absolute path of the directory that every account token file must be in. When empty, a token file may be anywhere the web server and poller users can read."
msgstr "Inzira yuzuye y'ububiko buri dosiye ya token ya konti igomba kubamo. Iyo ari ubusa, dosiye ya token ishobora kuba aho ari ho hose seriveri y'urubuga n'abakoresha ba poller bashobora gusoma."

